# `node_modules` without a trailing slash so a managed worktree that symlinks
# it to the primary checkout's install is ignored too; a symlink is not a
# directory, so `node_modules/` alone leaves it untracked and dirty, and a
# dirty worktree blocks governed PR delivery.
node_modules
*.tgz
agent-out/

# Local agent-harness state. Nothing in this repository writes it: the local
# agent pre-edit/validation hooks record their state here while a session runs.
# Leaving it untracked-and-visible makes `forge-cli pr deliver` refuse on an
# otherwise clean tree.
.cache/

# Project-local Claude directory (skills live in .agents/skills/)
.claude/
dist/
